# Optional build-time defaults. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to use.
#
# Default Spotify Client ID, used only when the Client ID in Settings > Music is empty
# (the value saved in Settings always wins). A Client ID is PUBLIC under OAuth PKCE
# (there is no client secret), so it is safe to ship in the bundle.
#
# WARNING: VITE_* variables are baked into the built JavaScript and visible to everyone.
# NEVER put secrets here: no client secret, no access/refresh tokens, no passwords.
# Spotify tokens exist at runtime only, in the app's local settings.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
